msgid "ARENA_TEST"
msgstr "Test Arena"

msgid "CHAR_BLOODLETTER"
msgstr "Bloodletter"

msgid "CHAR_BLOODLETTER_DESC"
msgstr "Bleeds whatever it touches and drinks what runs out. The drill hits often enough to make six percent of a hit worth having."

msgid "CHAR_BLOOD_BANK"
msgstr "Blood Bank"

msgid "CHAR_BLOOD_BANK_DESC"
msgstr "Pays for everything in maximum health - items, weapons and rerolls alike. Starts with more of it than anyone and spends it faster than it comes back."

msgid "CHAR_BULWARK"
msgstr "Bulwark"

msgid "CHAR_BULWARK_DESC"
msgstr "Six points of armour behind a hundred and sixty five health, slow enough that the horde catches up. Carries one weapon fewer than everybody else, which is the one thing the shop cannot sell back to you."

msgid "CHAR_FURNACE"
msgstr "Furnace"

msgid "CHAR_FURNACE_DESC"
msgstr "A walking boiler. Sets what it hits on fire more often than anything else in the roster, and hurts whatever is already burning."

msgid "CHAR_PROSPECTOR"
msgstr "Prospector"

msgid "CHAR_PROSPECTOR_DESC"
msgstr "Buys its way through the run: a third more currency, two more things offered every visit, and a fifth less damage to pay for it."

msgid "CHAR_RIVETER"
msgstr "Riveter"

msgid "CHAR_RIVETER_DESC"
msgstr "Fires faster than anything else on the rack, and hits softer for it. A flat damage bonus is worth less on every small shot, so it wants many improvements rather than one large one."

msgid "CHAR_SKIRMISHER"
msgstr "Skirmisher"

msgid "CHAR_SKIRMISHER_DESC"
msgstr "Never gets hit by the first bug through the door. Seventy health means the second one finishes it."

msgid "CHAR_STANDARD_UNIT"
msgstr "Standard Unit"

msgid "CHAR_STANDARD_UNIT_DESC"
msgstr "The frame every other chassis is measured against. Nothing given, nothing taken away - a Bolt Driver and whatever you make of it."

msgid "CHAR_TEST"
msgstr "Test Rig"

